WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.165
当视觉语言动作模型一次预测一段动作时，环境可能已经变化，机器人却仍在执行过期动作。RadeonVLA-Reflex 让执行链能够及时中断、检测失败并恢复。
When a VLA predicts an action chunk, the world may change while stale actions remain in control. RadeonVLA-Reflex makes execution interruptible, failure-aware, and recoverable.

00:00:24.165 --> 00:00:44.564
我们用五种水果、四个语言可指定碗、共二十项基础任务验证系统。水果分拣是测试台，核心贡献是可中断、可恢复、可审计的 VLA 执行层。
We validate on five fruits and four language-addressable bowls: twenty basic tasks. Fruit sorting is the testbed; the contribution is an interruptible, recoverable, auditable VLA runtime.

00:00:44.564 --> 00:01:08.729
世界相机、腕部相机、九维状态和语言输入 SmolVLA。指令版本变化时，旧动作块立即失效；所有动作先经过安全检查，失败检测持续读取真实夹爪宽度和目标高度。
World RGB, wrist RGB, 9-D state, and language condition SmolVLA. A command-version change invalidates stale chunks; safety and failure monitors inspect every action and measured gripper state.

00:01:08.729 --> 00:01:30.697
Physical-2K 包含两千条严格物理成功轨迹、二十乘一百任务覆盖和四十六万八千八百八十九帧。两千份证书全部通过验证，错误和警告均为零。
Physical-2K contains 2,000 strict-physics successes, exact 20 × 100 coverage, and 468,889 frames. All 2,000 certificates pass with zero errors and zero warnings.

00:01:30.697 --> 00:01:52.352
仿真、采集、训练和闭环推理均运行在 AMD Radeon 上。模型累计训练约二十万步，最后十万步耗时三小时四十五分钟，最终损失零点零五八。
Simulation, collection, training, and closed-loop inference run on AMD Radeon. The model reaches about 200K cumulative steps; the final 100K continuation takes 3 h 45 min with loss 0.058.

00:01:52.352 --> 00:02:09.612
正常闭环完成接近、物理夹持、抬升、搬运和释放。成功必须由水果稳定落入指定碗后的空间门禁确认，不对水果做后处理。
Normal closed-loop execution approaches, physically grasps, lifts, transports, and releases. Success is verified only after stable placement in the requested bowl—without object post-processing.

00:02:09.612 --> 00:02:33.464
学习策略空抓后，Precision Reflex 执行有界几何恢复。恢复期间仍禁止刚体位姿写入、抓取粘附和放置瞬移，恢复贡献会与纯模型首次成功分开统计。
After a learned empty grasp, Precision Reflex runs bounded geometric recovery. Rigid pose writes, grasp glue, and placement teleports remain forbidden, and recovery is reported separately from learned first-attempt success.

00:02:33.464 --> 00:02:57.001
正式一百次闭环中，纯模型首次成功率为 36%，精确恢复贡献为 55%，最终成功率为 91%。P50 为 4.54 毫秒，P95 为 37.27 毫秒。
Across 100 formal rollouts, learned first-attempt success is 36%, precision-recovery contribution is 55%, and final success is 91%. Latency is 4.54 ms P50 and 37.27 ms P95.

00:02:57.001 --> 00:03:11.751
中途改令时，新指令先让旧动作块失效，再安全停顿并执行新任务，避免机械臂继续完成已经撤销的意图。
On a mid-execution command change, the new version invalidates stale actions before a safe hold and new task execution, preventing the robot from completing revoked intent.

00:03:11.751 --> 00:03:36.858
代码、Physical-2K、模型权重、评测证据、技术报告、网站和复现命令全部公开。当前结果仅覆盖 Genesis 仿真，不声称真机或 sim-to-real。
Source, Physical-2K, model weights, evaluation evidence, report, website, and reproduction commands are public. Results cover Genesis simulation only; no real-robot or sim-to-real claim is made.
